  "description": "The text 'a group of baboons is called a congress' maps the visual entity 'baboons' (a group of primates) onto the textual concept 'congress' (a human political body). This creates an analogical mapping where the visual group of baboons is equated with a political institution, forming the core pun and humorous comparison in the meme.",
